omponents/collapsible-29","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"CollapsiblePanel provides the content spacing automatically. Use `contentProps` to customize its\ninner container with Box spacing props, a class name, or styles:"},"439":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-30","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `contentProps={{ padding: '0' }}` for content without padding. Props supplied directly to\nCollapsiblePanel, including `className`, `style`, and `ref`, apply to the outer panel."},"440":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-31","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `defaultExpanded` for initial expansion, or `isExpanded` with `onExpandedChange` for controlled\nstate. The callback receives a boolean. Use the Accordion component to coordinate several sections;\nin that composition, manage expansion through the group."},"441":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-32","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Use `className` and `style` to customize each component. Button supports string or state-based\n`className` values. Components expose these data attributes for state-based styling:"},"442":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-33","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`Collapsible`: `data-expanded`, `data-disabled`, and `data-focus-visible-within`."},"443":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-34","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"Trigger `Button`: `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, and `data-disabled`."},"444":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-35","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#customization","content":"`CollapsiblePanel`: `data-focus-visible-within`."},"445":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-36","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Key"},"446":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-37","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Action"},"447":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-38","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"`Tab` / `Shift + Tab`"},"448":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-39","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Move between the enabled trigger and controls in the expanded panel"},"449":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-40","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"`Enter` / `Space`"},"450":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-41","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#keyboard","content":"Toggle the section; focus stays on the trigger"},"451":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-42","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`Button slot=\"trigger\"` renders a native button with `aria-expanded` for its open state and\n`aria-controls` linked to the panel automatically."},"452":{"id":"/docs/components/collapsible-43","page_id":"/docs/components/collapsible","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/collapsible#aria","content":"`CollapsiblePanel` is labeled by its trigger through `aria-labelledby` automatically."},"453":{"id":"/docs/components/collap