"id":"/docs/components/listbox-15","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox#features","content":"`ListBox` requires either `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`. For a labeled, popover-style picker, prefer `Select`."},"843":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-16","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox#default","content":"Single selection with static children. Use `aria-label` to give the listbox an accessible name."},"844":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-17","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox#list-box-controlled","content":"Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state."},"845":{"id":"/docs/components/listbox-18","page_id":"/docs/components/listbox","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/listbox#list-box-multiple","content":"Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values. `selectedKeys` is a `Set<Key>` (or the literal `'all'`)."},"846":{"id":"/docs/components/menu","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"page","content":"Menu","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu"},"847":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-0","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu","content":"Accessible dropdown menu with grouping, multi-select checkbox items, leading icons, and submenus."},"848":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-1","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Features"},"849":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-2","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#installation","content":"Installation"},"850":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-3","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#examples","content":"Examples"},"851":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-4","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#default","content":"Default"},"852":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-5","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#controlled","content":"Controlled"},"853":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-6","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#bottom-sheet","content":"Bottom Sheet"},"854":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-7","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#groups","content":"Groups"},"855":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-8","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#multiple-selection","content":"Multiple Selection"},"856":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-9","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#rich-content-from-an-item","content":"Rich Content From an Item"},"857":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-10","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#single-selection","content":"Single Selection"},"858":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-11","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#sizes","content":"Sizes"},"859":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-12","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#submenu","content":"Submenu"},"860":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-13","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"Accessibility"},"861":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-14","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Best Practices"},"862":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-15","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#props","content":"Props"},"863":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-16","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menu","content":"Menu"},"864":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-17","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menutrigger","content":"MenuTrigger"},"865":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-18","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menugroup","content":"MenuGroup"},"866":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-19","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menuitem","content":"MenuItem"},"867":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-20","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#menuseparator","content":"MenuSeparator"},"868":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-21","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/menu#submenutrigger","content":"SubmenuTrigger"},"869":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-22","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu","content":"An accessible dropdown menu built on React Aria. It supports grouping with optional\ntitles, multi-select checkbox items, leading icons, submenus, and two sizes. It\nreuses Antares' `Popover` for the overlay and `Checkbox` indicator for selection."},"870":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-23","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Grouping with an optional title via `MenuGroup`, plus `MenuSeparator` dividers"},"871":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-24","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Multi-select groups: set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` on a `MenuGroup` to render\nits items as checkboxes, while other groups stay plain action items"},"872":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-25","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Optional leading `icon` per item; links (`href`) and disabled items"},"873":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-26","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Submenus via `SubmenuTrigger`"},"874":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-27","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Two sizes (`sm`, `md`); set `size` explicitly on each submenu `Menu`"},"875":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-28","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#features","content":"Usable anchored to a trigger or standalone (e.g. inside a bottom-sheet `Drawer`)"},"876":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-29","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#default","content":"A trigger with plain action items."},"877":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-30","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#controlled","content":"`MenuTrigger` exposes its open state via `isOpen`/`onOpenChange`,\nwhich can be used to drive the rotation of a chevron icon."},"878":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-31","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#bottom-sheet","content":"On small screens a menu often reads better as a bottom sheet than an anchored\npopover. Since `Menu` works standalone, drop it into a bottom `Drawer`."},"879":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-32","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#groups","content":"Labeled groups separated by dividers, a multi-select checkbox group mixed with\nplain action groups, leading icons, a disabled item, and a link."},"880":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-33","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#multiple-selection","content":"A `MenuGroup` with `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` renders its items as checkboxes.\nDrive the checked items with `selectedKeys` + `onSelectionChange` or\nseed them uncontrolled with `defaultSelectedKeys`. Keys correspond to each\n`MenuItem`'s `id`."},"881":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-34","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#rich-content-from-an-item","content":"A `Menu` is a collection, so it only renders `MenuItem`, `MenuGroup`,\n`MenuSeparator`, and `SubmenuTrigger` children. Rich content inside a `Menu`\nor submenu is not supported. To show a `Calendar`, let the item close the\nmenu from `onAction` and open a separate `Popover` anchored to the trigger\nwith `triggerRef`."},"882":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-35","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#single-selection","content":"A `MenuGroup` with `selectionMode=\"single\"` lets one item be selected at a time.\nDrive it with `selectedKeys` + `onSelectionChange` or seed it uncontrolled with\n`defaultSelectedKeys`. Keys correspond to each `MenuItem`'s `id`."},"883":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-36","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#sizes","content":"`size` controls item density. Shown here as two standalone menus so both\nsizes are visible at once; in practice you set `size` on the `Menu` inside a\n`MenuTrigger`."},"884":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-37","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#submenu","content":"Nested menus via `SubmenuTrigger`."},"885":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-38","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Space/Enter**: activate an item; **Escape**: close"},"886":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-39","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Arrow Up/Down**: move between items; **Home/End**: first/last"},"887":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-40","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Arrow Right/Left**: open/close a submenu"},"888":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-41","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"**Type to select**: jump to a matching item (string labels are used as `textValue`)"},"889":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-42","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#accessibility","content":"Multi-select items use RAC's `menuitemcheckbox` role; the checkbox indicator is\ndecorative (`aria-hidden`) and the item owns interaction"},"890":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-43","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Give each selectable `MenuItem` a stable `id`, and provide the `Menu` an\n`aria-label` when there is no visible label."},"891":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-44","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Use a leading `icon` for recognition, not as the only label - keep a text label."},"892":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-45","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"Reserve checkbox groups for multi-select; use plain groups for one-shot actions."},"893":{"id":"/docs/components/menu-46","page_id":"/docs/components/menu","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/menu#best-practices","content":"A `Menu` is a collection: it only renders `MenuItem`, `MenuGroup`,\n`MenuSeparator`, and `SubmenuTrigger`. For rich content (a `Calendar`, a form),\nclose the menu from `onAction` and open a separate `Popover` anchored with\n`triggerRef` instead of putting it in a submenu."},"894":{"id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","page_id":"/docs/components/metrics-lockup","type":"page","content":"MetricsLockup","breadcrumbs":["