/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal","content":"`ModalTrigger` wraps a trigger button and a `<Modal>`, handling open state automatically. Based on RAC `DialogTrigger`."},"942":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-17","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal","content":"The modal is a `SizeProvider`. It opens at the size of the scope around its trigger, even though it renders in a portal, and `size` overrides that."},"943":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-18","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#default","content":"Compose a Modal from a `Heading slot=\"title\"`, a `CloseButton`, `Content`, and a\n`ButtonGroup`. `ModalTrigger` opens the Modal and manages its open/close state."},"944":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-19","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#controlled","content":"Pass `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` to `ModalTrigger` to control the open state externally."},"945":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-20","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#scrollable","content":"When the content is taller than the viewport, the `Content` region scrolls while the title\nrow and the `ButtonGroup` stay pinned."},"946":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-21","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#triggerless","content":"`Modal` accepts `isOpen` and `onOpenChange` directly, so it can be controlled without a\n`ModalTrigger`. Useful when the modal is opened from several places at once."},"947":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-22","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#size","content":"`size` sets the modal's text, controls, and spacing. Without it, the modal follows the size\nscope around its trigger."},"948":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-23","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#with-text-lockup","content":"A `TextLockup` in the content keeps its own title. The modal's `Heading slot=\"title\"` still names\nthe dialog."},"949":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-24","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Key"},"950":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-25","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Action"},"951":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-26","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"`Tab`"},"952":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-27","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Moves focus to the next focusable element inside the modal"},"953":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-28","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"`Escape`"},"954":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-29","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#keyboard-interaction","content":"Closes the modal (unless `isKeyboardDismissDisabled`)"},"955":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-30","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#aria","content":"`role=\"dialog\"` is applied automatically by the underlying React Aria `Dialog`"},"956":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-31","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#aria","content":"Focus is trapped within the modal while open and returned to the trigger on close"},"957":{"id":"/docs/components/modal-32","page_id":"/docs/components/modal","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/modal#best-practices","content":"Always include a `Heading slot=\"title\"` so the dialog has an accessib