ading** frequently used icons to reduce loading delays"],[838,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `selectedKeys` and `onSelectionChange` for controlled state, or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled."],[1017,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1358,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1641,"**Controlled or uncontrolled**: Use `value` and `onChange` for controlled state, or `defaultValue` for uncontrolled"],[1689,"**Controls keep the scale size.** A `Button` inside a lockup follows the surrounding\n`SizeProvider` or its own `size` prop, never the lockup's tier."],[1640,"**Controls**: A `Button slot=\"control\"` beside the input is an interactive affix; it picks up field chrome from context"],[2064,"**Custom Components:** When using `as={MyComponent}`, Box accepts that component's props. If there's a prop name conflict, Box's props take priority."],[1849,"**Custom domains**: Set explicit x and y ranges for controlled scales across multiple charts"],[1848,"**Customizable axes**: Control gridlines, tick marks, axis titles, and tick formatting"],[1910,"**Debounce resize**: The default 15ms debounce on `useParentSize` balances smoothness and performance"],[729,"**Deduplication**: Icon path data only exists once in the sprite sheet, regardless of how many times it's used"],[1846,"**Design system alignment**: 8px border radius, 12px bar width (1.5 GU), consistent spacing"],[731,"**DOM Output:**"],[1755,"**End**"],[676,"**Events**: `onClick`, `onMouseOver`, `onFocus`, etc."],[1684,"**Every part names its role with a slot**: `eyebrow`, `title`, `body`. Unslotted text follows\nthe lockup's tier too: a bare `Heading` takes the title tier and a bare `Text` the body tier."],[747,"**Fallback content**: Provide placeholder content for loading states"],[735,"**Faster Rendering**: Browser optimizations for `<use>` elements"],[720,"**First Request**: When an icon is first encountered, it triggers an asynchronous fetch from the CDN"],[669,"**Flexible sizing**: Support for `width` and `height` props"],[1361,"**Form integration**: Set `name` and the value submits as part of a native `<form>` (multiple values submit as repeated entries)"],[723,"**Full SVG Rendering**: Each icon instance renders as a complete SVG element with all path data"],[1869,"**Group gap**: Minimum 24px between bar groups"],[1881,"**Grouped rendering**: Bars are rendered in SVG `<Group>` elements for logical organization"],[1753,"**Home**"],[1884,"**Horizontal charts**: Vertical scrolling when many categories exceed container height"],[1873,"**Horizontal scrolling**: When data points exceed available width, the chart becomes horizontally scrollable"],[2063,"**HTML Elements:** When using `as=\"button\"`, TypeScript enforces button-specific props like `type`, `disabled`, and `onClick`."],[2054,"**Important**: Since `Flex` and `Grid` extend `Box`, prefer them for layouts. Use `Box` only when you need a non-flex, non-grid container."],[698,"**Important**: When you supply a `className`, you make a commitment to take over all styling of the component as it will remove the standard class names. Use data attributes for targeted styling instead."],[738,"**Initial Flash**: Brief moment where icons appear/disappear during sprite injection"],[1847,"**Interactive tooltips**: Hover to see exact values, with smart positioning and scroll-awareness"],[293,"**isInvalid**: Shows error state styling"],[292,"**isRequired**: Marks the group as required with visual indicator"],[1876,"**Keyboard navigation**: Bar groups are keyboard accessible with `tabIndex={0}` and `role=\"group\"`"],[839,"**Layout primitive**: `ListBox` and `ListBoxItem` accept layout props (`gap`, `padding`, etc.) — they extend `FlexOwnProps`."],[1772,"**Left** — when the group controls content directly below or within the same column (dashboards, tables)."],[1909