e mode** when the same icons appear many times (navigation, lists, tables)"],[750,"**Use sprite mode**: For repeated icons, consider sprite mode which consolidates multiple icons into a single SVG sprite sheet, reducing DOM size and improving performance when the same icon appears multiple times"],[1018,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1359,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1643,"**Validation states**: Use `isInvalid` with a `FieldError` and `isDisabled` for validation and disabled state"],[1016,"**Value scale**: `minValue`, `maxValue`, `step`, and `formatOptions` configure the numeric behavior"],[1907,"**Verify event targets**: Tooltips use mouse event coordinates and bar group positions"],[1844,"**Vertical and horizontal orientations**: Choose the best layout for your data and use case"],[1883,"**Vertical charts**: Horizontal scrolling when many data points exceed container width"],[1853,"**VisX integration**: Leverages VisX primitives for scales, axes, shapes, and responsive layout"],[726,"**What happens with sprite mode:**"],[1473,"`--color-input-background-default`"],[1470,"`--color-input-background-selected`"],[1479,"`--color-input-text-default`"],[1480,"`--ux-1glcx6s`"],[1468,"`--ux-1m9ys0v`"],[1474,"`--ux-1nu8itt`"],[1477,"`--ux-1sbfig8`"],[1471,"`--ux-sywk25`"],[1483,"`--ux-zvaw3s`"],[206,"`@godaddy/antares/date` re-exports `@internationalized/date`, the package behind these date primitives."],[2149,"`<Box blockAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2151,"`<Box inlineAlignChildren=\"center\">`"],[2145,"`<Box orientation=\"horizontal\">`"],[2147,"`<Box orientation=\"vertical\">`"],[2152,"`<Flex alignItems=\"center\">`"],[2148,"`<Flex direction=\"column\" >`"],[2146,"`<Flex direction=\"row\" >`"],[2150,"`<Flex justifyContent=\"center\">`"],[2061,"`2xl` - 2x extra large spacing"],[608,"`acceptedFileTypes` is a 